{
  "description": "New synthetic held-out topics written before inference; no score threshold fitted.",
  "documents": [
    {
      "id": "new-01",
      "text": "雨棚修好以后，院子里的自行车座垫不再被夜雨淋湿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-02",
      "text": "社区图书馆周三闭馆清点藏书，借来的书可以投入门外还书箱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-03",
      "text": "种在北窗的薄荷长得很慢，挪到南阳台两周后出现了新叶。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-04",
      "text": "这次团队复盘把事实时间线和每个人的猜测分成两栏，以免混淆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-05",
      "text": "打印机卡纸时先断电，再打开后盖检查滚轮；此条只是合成设备日志。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-06",
      "text": "读书会决定先讨论结尾，再回头比较不同人物对同一事件的描述。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-07",
      "text": "合成旅行笔记：湖边步道因落石暂时封闭，游客改走山脚的铺装道路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-08",
      "text": "工作记录：客户演示使用冻结的数据副本，避免现场内容随后台更新而改变。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-09",
      "text": "合成家务记录：玻璃罐上的旧标签用温水浸泡后整片脱落，罐子留下装种子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-10",
      "text": "骑行路线避开施工中的木桥，绕过邮局后从石桥过河。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-11",
      "text": "合成课程笔记：孩子先用积木搭出不同长度，再学习尺子上的刻度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-12",
      "text": "午间讨论提出把耗时的报表导出移到后台，完成时再显示下载链接。"
    },
    {
      "id": "new-13",
      "text": "The synthetic museum visit notes say the pottery gallery is upstairs and photography is prohibited in that room."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-14",
      "text": "For the fictional neighborhood concert, volunteers collect reusable cups at the exits and wash them for the next event."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-15",
      "text": "The project log records that a slow database query became faster after an index was added to the invoice date column."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-16",
      "text": "A synthetic packing checklist groups charging cables in one small pouch so they can be found without unpacking the suitcase."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-17",
      "text": "The fictional bakery saves yesterday’s unsold bread for making toasted crumbs rather than throwing it away."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-18",
      "text": "During the mock workshop, participants write questions anonymously before the facilitator groups similar concerns on a board."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-19",
      "text": "The garden journal is synthetic: a shallow bowl of water was placed away from the seedlings so birds would not disturb the young plants."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-20",
      "text": "The test application keeps a local draft when a connection drops and asks the writer before replacing a newer server version."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-21",
      "text": "The imaginary train station moved the bicycle parking racks beside the east entrance, underneath the covered walkway."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-22",
      "text": "The synthetic lecture notes distinguish correlation from causation and use two unrelated seasonal trends as an example."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-23",
      "text": "For the fictional film club, captions are enabled by default and seats near the speakers are left optional rather than assigned."
    },
    {
      "id": "new-24",
      "text": "The design review removed a surprise auto-play sound and replaced it with a visible play button that users choose to press."
    }
  ],
